ine next actions to setup [[inheritance]] for all my broker accounts\n* TODO Introduce option to disable animation in [[logseq]]\n* TODO Fix changing statusbar colors in dark mode in [[logseq]]\n* TODO Upgrade Windows 10 to Windows 11 on Nastya's laptop\n* DONE Fix volume scaling in linux on thor\n* TODO Try to enable email encryption in Kraken\n* Vote for municipal elections in 2025\n:PROPERTIES:\n:collapsed: true\n:END:\n** TODO Redo [[https://vaalit.yle.fi/vaalikone/alue-ja-kuntavaalit2025?language=ru][Компас избирателя Yle | Региональные и муниципальные выборы 2025 | Yle]]\nSCHEDULED: <2025-04-01 Tue>\n** TODO Vote on the municipal elections\nSCHEDULED: <2025-04-03 Thu>\n* Finalize [[Taxes 2024]]\n** DONE Submit a new pre-completed tax return request with all my dividends for 2024\nSCHEDULED: <2025-03-20 Thu>\nDEADLINE: <2025-04-05 Sat>\n** DONE Submit a new tax card with interest on uninvested cash from Lightyear, Trading212\nSCHEDULED: <2025-03-25 Tue>\n** TODO Wait for a response from the tax office about my taxes for 2024\n[[../assets/image_1742890781934_0.png]]\n[[../assets/image_1742890806920_0.png]]\n[[../assets/image_1742890820844_0.png]]\n[[../assets/image_1742890837054_0.png]]\n** TODO Help Elena to fill in the precompleted tax returns for 2024 (Revolut, Norwegian)\nDEADLINE: <2025-04-05 Sat>\n\nPääomatuloa olevat eläkkeet ja pitkäaikaissäästämissopimuksen (PS-sopimus)\nmukaiset suoritukset sekä muut pääomatulot\n** Wait for a response from the tax office about Elena's taxes for 2024\n* TODO Try to fix the sofa in the living room #outside\n* DONE Define next actions to plan [[Helsinki-Gdansk]] trip\n* [[Helsinki-Gdansk]] trip\n** TODO Wait for Elena to organize holidays for herself in June\n** DONE Check the alternative route Helsinki-Stockholm-Gdansk-Travemunde-Helsink\n** Book the ferries\n** Book the stay in Gdansk via Revolut\n** Equip the bags for [[Helsinki-Gdansk]] trip\n** Define next actions to follow the schedule of [[Helsinki-Gdansk]] trip\n